WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.800
Hi, I'm Rasheed. I'm the newest member of the
Robotics Cohort in the Atlanta AI and Robotics

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:17.060
Initiative in summer 2026. This summer, I've had
the opportunity to have hands-on experience

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:26.040
in hardware manufacturing, robotics, and just
old-fashioned programming as well. Across the

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:34.400
board, it's been great to have access to
resources like mentorship from cutting-edge
entrepreneurs

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:40.920
in the tech space and experienced professionals
in the corporate technology world as well from

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:48.160
companies like Waymo and Amazon. Also, and a
personal favorite part of the program for

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:54.600
me has been the ability to work with budding
scientists from starting from ages 14 and

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:04.560
up on robotics projects that interest us both
and allow us both to grow and learn together.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:11.900
I think if you're interested in technology in
general, if you're interested in pursuing

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.320
mentorship or certification in technology, then
the Atlanta AI and Robotics Initiative

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:23.860
is something that can really jumpstart your
career and put you in the right mindset

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:28.860
to make a difference here in Atlanta, but also
in any room you walk into.
